OL,3,GNEWSAEx-councillor guilty of sex crimes
OL,4,Aagainst cadets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former city councillor has been
OL,7,Fconvicted of sexual offences, many
OL,8,Finvolving boys he had instructed as an
OL,9,FArmy cadet leader.
OL,11,FAfter 11 hours of deliberations, a jury
OL,12,Fat Ipswich Crown Court found Rylan Ray
OL,13,Fguilty of 23 crimes including the rape
OL,14,Fof a man he met on a night out.
OL,16,FThe case involved 11 male complainants,
OL,17,Fmany of them teenagers the former
OL,18,FConservative politician had met through
OL,19,Fhis role with the Cambridgeshire Army
OL,20,FCadet Force.
